  title: Anglo-Mysore Wars
  text: Four wars between 1767 and 1799 between the Company and Mysore, under Haidar Ali and Tipu Sultan, ended with Tipu's death at Srirangapatna in 1799 and the restoration of the Wodeyars under British control.
